# 04 - Button Press Counter

## Objective



## Components Used

- ESP32
- 220 Ω resistor
- Push button
- Breadboard
- Jumper wires

## Concepts

- GPIO Output
- HIGH and LOW states
- pinMode()
- INPUT_PULLUP
- digitalWrite()
- if/else statements
- variables

## Wiring

- LED Anode → GPIO 16
- LED Cathode → GND (through a 220 Ω resistor)
- Push button pin 1 → GPIO23
- Push button pin 2 → GND

